es since 7 October 2023; and* > > *(c) ensures that higher education providers must comply with recommendations of the National Student Ombudsman concerning the National Higher Education Code to Prevent and Respond to Anti-Semitism\".*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-9673","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2025-07-31/5"}
